WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.422 --> 00:00:02.868
MOBIUS
You picked up the Tesseract,

00:00:02.868 --> 00:00:04.071
breaking reality.

00:00:04.782 --> 00:00:06.586
I want you to help us fix it.

00:00:06.610 --> 00:00:07.915
LOKI
Not my forte.

00:00:07.915 --> 00:00:09.688
MOBIUS
Pretend your life depends on it.

00:00:09.688 --> 00:00:11.053
I'm going to get a snack.

00:00:12.709 --> 00:00:14.709
LOKI
I am the god of mischief.

00:00:15.115 --> 00:00:18.990
It is adorable that you
think you can manipulate me.

00:00:19.615 --> 00:00:21.320
I was just standing
up to make a point.

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:22.328
MOBIUS
I'm sorry, go ahead.

00:00:22.328 --> 00:00:23.523
LOKI
It won't be as meaningful now.

00:00:23.523 --> 00:00:24.734
MOBIUS
Okay, well, stay seated.

00:00:24.734 --> 00:00:26.401
LOKI
I'll do what I want to do!

